        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 50,
      "author": {
        "id": 1056478
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-26T22:52:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Naming convention for these is (might be easier to clean these up now than later when its hardcoded in the bowels of vendor code):\nandroid.telephony.mbms.action.DOWNLOAD_RESULT_INTERNAL\n\nAlso, suggest:\nACTION_DOWNLOAD_COMPLETE",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 50,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 50,
        "endChar": 67
      },
      "revId": "8de31ce9792f7d596eeff7eb8ae7e47f66988309",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5909371b_c7605591",
        "filename": "telephony/java/android/telephony/MbmsDownloadManager.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 54,
      "author": {
        "id": 1056478
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-26T22:52:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These seem like two different things; would be make sense to have\nACTION_REQUEST_TEMPORARY_FILE_DESCRIPTOR\nand\nACTION_RESUME_PAUSED_DOWNLOAD\nseparated?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 53,
        "startChar": 52,
        "endLine": 54,
        "endChar": 85
      },
      "revId": "8de31ce9792f7d596eeff7eb8ae7e47f66988309",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
